    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweerajeega nyarasta ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaayiinyi ghuuta haw nyaasha jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA nea gwayeesha malaykajeegiga asispwaan, “Aweayeena ak ghoahiidi gweerajeegiga as ispwa bea nyarasta ASEETA mida badayda ng'eanyiidean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa malaykajeanda madeeda ak ghoahiida gweeriidaanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida, hean ghoaptu deaneaduutka munyas bea ririnnyeanda mideawa giirooraneedeaba diyeaydideani ak ghaghadoawan gidida siratiida ninyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea malaykajeandida bea iyeenyean goohiisa gweeriidaanyi jeeda basooda, ak ghwayamwa gawuurji foojeanda siida meah, hean gameewa haleanjeeda sean mideawa eaweega mida jeeda basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoahiida malaykajeandida bea samwaguun gweeriidaanyi jeeda eeniga ea gheanyanga beega, ak ghoah foojeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaayiinyi malaykajeanda ambal beega nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goohiisa malaykajeandida bea ang'waniin gweeriidaanyi badayda aseeta, ak geenung' ghaghwarda buuneeda aba beasta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geaghwarda buuneeda aba beasta ng'waan, ak ghamwaashta saawa gheawunga ASEETA mideawa uurda aba badaydeaba sawanaduutsu, ak ea maduukuunana ak ghoadaw niny giigheambiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goohiisa malaykajeandida bea muudiin gweeriidaanyi badayda hoorgeeda gheambalmeedeaba diyeaydida, ak geenung' gamisaniit sugoocheanduumeadaanyi; hean ghwanyeanyea buuneeda ng'ushapkeaka nyaawa aba siilalga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamwaashta ASEETA humng'eeda aba sawanaduutka nyaawa ea deaneaduutka nyaawa, ak ea maduukuunana sinaweega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goohiisa malaykajeandida bea lahiin gweeriidaanyi jeeda eenda haw siguura Furatiin, hean ghwajaam beagaaschi, ak geesissin naweeda sugoodiga leabu heeda ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaadaayi, ng'asheega rinna ghuuta ichibooda ea ghuuta diyeayda ea gea ghuusiga sibanga ng'uyeega, ea gurooruunat samwagu munyas uurji udagheambagajeamajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suh gurooruunatka meangeenda gil, sina gwadeagwajeega, inyeessa gwarita ak gaweesa sugoodiga mida giigheawda bea ng'eanyiissean, ak ghoamughuush saawa aba ng'ucheedida aba eaweeda haw bea ASEETA Hoauuriin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi, gaydoanda mareanghweanda! Ghang'wana siida majeek, nea ghaghamwat hang'weakaaschi ak ea mawa nea dawiish ak geadaah baspaseegaaschi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goomuguushsa saawa hiji siguura aba ghuuta Ebraniya Armagedoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goohiisa malaykajeandida bea ispwaan gweeriidaanyi humng'eeda, ak gwarina nyeashta haw jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, heeda hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda, nea gwayi, “Nigeawiit gwasa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwardu dadamandeeda, ea nyeashta, ea gighweendandeeda, ea sawooda haw bea ng'eanyiida dea eara heeda ghayi miigwardu dea uurji nih dea niibiideewa buuneeda badayda ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba sawooni bea ng'eanyiidean aahaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaheeli mujiineedida hawiin niba samwagu, ak ghoabeada mujiinajeega eemoojiga, ak ghoapkaat ASEETA Babeleedida hawiin, ak geataw gweeriida difaayeeda nyarastaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo ea ng'eanyiida neaweesa beega gaygamng'aw, ak ea manda giijeega jea gudeadaah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gang'adeesa buuneeda roopta haw bea lagheanga durumani muuchi, ak goobitpisa buuneeda nea gwaleabu humng'eeda, ea eeyi bwak ea ghamwaashta buuneeda ASEETA aba sawanadeeda nyas aba lagheanga, ak ghoabeal fih sawanadeedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
